	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Blackberry-style mechanical jog ball (EVQWJN007 class), 11.0 x 9.0mm body, two 0.9mm mounting spigots on the x axis. PURELY MECHANICAL: the unit has no electrical pins. Motion is read by four hall switches on the back of the board, under the spindle magnets at the corners; the click is a dome under the centre. Body and hole geometry follow the SparkFun Trackballer reference board and are UNVERIFIED against a part in hand.")
